      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BORROWED TIMES (6) is an honest type in the frame at four of 12 starts including last time when third (22.71) over 388m at this track. Solid record at the distance winning three races. Happy to have him on top this line-up.   was a (17.48) winner last time out at Taree SUPER Track from Box 3. Good beginner assisted by the inside draw. Has hit winning form and can measure up again. KENNY'S GIRL (7) was prominent throughout when winning two back then got further back last time but came home hard into third and beaten 3.5 lengths at Taree SUPER Track (17.58). Good beginner but will need a little luck early crossing from an outside draw. Will give a great sight again. MY JULIA (2) was well fancied in betting last start but could only manage 1.75 lengths away in second (17.70). Good beginner aided by a nice draw.",
